<title>FINLAND: VALMET SAYS GETS RATINGS BY S&amp;P, MOODY'S.</title>
<headline>VALMET SAYS GETS RATINGS BY S&amp;P, MOODY'S.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish paper machine maker Valmet Oy said on Thursday it had been assigned a rating of BBB+/A-2 by Standard &amp; Poor's, and a counterparty rating of Baa2 by Moody's.</p>
<p>&quot;The ratings from both leading credit rating agencies strengthen Valmet's position and expand its opportunities on the international financial markets,&quot; Valmet said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
